# Input

```sass
$color: red

@mixin theme($c)
  color: $c

.foo
  @include theme($color)
  @if $color
    color: blue
  @else
    color: green
  &:hover
    color: red

```


# Formatted

```sass
$color: red

@mixin theme($c)
	color: $c

.foo
	@include theme($color)
	@if $color
		color: blue
	@else
		color: green
	&:hover
		color: red

```
